on as F_y, a separate node that intervening on my F_x leaves at its prior, so I'm working through the payoffs with r as its probability. Send comes out better for any r, so under A-FDT the strict reading is defect, even though a policy-level view would cooperate.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy's decision really depends on my function under A-FDT. It runs the same function on a different input, Rowan's perspective, so its action would be F_y rather than F_x. Intervening on mine would leave theirs at its prior, unless the input differences are treated as irrelevant to the output.\n\nI'm treating the other copy's computation as F_y, a separate node that intervening on my F_x leaves at its prior, so I'm working through the payoffs with r as its probability. Send comes out better for any r, so under A-FDT the strict reading is defect, even though a policy-level view would cooperate.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10001,"completion_tokens":988,"total_tokens":10989,"cost":0.059764,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.059764,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.040004,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01976},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":531,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}